      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.689,
            0.048,
            0.86,
            0.066
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fractions in Disguise"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.101,
            0.795,
            0.152
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "More generally, y% of some value, say 80, is given by "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{y}{100} \\times 80."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " We can also say that 45% of some value, say z, is given by "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 4 5 } { 1 0 0 } } \\times z ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.178,
            0.456,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Free-hand Computations"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.208,
            0.787,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We just calculated 25% of 120. Is 25% the same as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "th",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (a quarter)? Suppose we want to find 25% of 40. Is it the same as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "th",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of 40? Yes, since 25 is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " th (a quarter) of 100 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( { \\frac { 2 5 } { 1 0 0 } } = { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } } \\right)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Therefore 25% of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40=\\frac{25}{100}\\times40"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the same as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 1 } { 4 } } \\times 4 0 ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.316,
            0.846,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Try to calculate (without using pen and paper) the indicated percentages of the values shown in the table below. Write your answers in the table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.371,
            0.789,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.208,
                0.371,
                0.789,
                0.617
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_table_5.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td>100</td><td>200</td><td>50</td><td>80</td><td>10</td><td>35</td><td>287</td></tr><tr><td>25%</td><td>25</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>10%</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>20%</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>5%</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.632,
            0.799,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? How did you find these values? Discuss the methods with the class. Do you find anything interesting in the table?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.675,
            0.802,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You may have noticed that 20% of a value is double that of 10% of the same value. This will always happen as 20% (20 parts out of 100) is twice that of 10% (10 parts out of 100)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.816,
            0.643,
            0.902,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.816,
                0.643,
                0.902,
                0.699
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.741,
            0.845,
            0.781
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Using this understanding, mentally calculate how much 40% of the values in the table above would be."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.784,
            0.841,
            0.804
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What relationship do you observe among 20%, 5% and 25% of a value?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.802,
            0.845,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It appears that (20% of y) + (5% of y) = 25% of y. We can verify that this property always holds:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.355,
            0.839,
            0.642,
            0.87
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "{ \\Big ( } { \\frac { 2 0 } { 1 0 0 } } \\times y { \\Big ) } + { \\Big ( } { \\frac { 5 } { 1 0 0 } } \\times y { \\Big ) } = { \\Big ( } { \\frac { 2 5 } { 1 0 0 } } \\times y { \\Big ) } ."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
